# The Whole of Thornmere — the lookout's reveal: F major, the strings rising out of the Stand's
# wind, a harp's sweep, the pack's call whole on a horn as the names fade in. Original, cb17
# (2026-10-29). 3 bars of 4/4 at 90: 8 s, once, held to its end like the sting.
